+/*
+ * H.264 DSP kernels for the PSP (Allegrex + VFPU): weighted prediction.
+ *
+ * See vfpu_util.h for the number representation. Only the 8-bit 4:2:0
+ * decoder path is covered; everything else falls back to the C code.
+ *
+ * This file is part of FFmpeg.
